From af367d66798a88b0b8e389b91ca5cb74d521d235 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:06:03 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: Reloaded enemy data and element presets

Ported by scripts/port-reloaded-tables.py from the Golden Sun Reloaded v1.83a rebalance (forum.goldensunhacking.net topic 2779); the credit is in the table's header. The enemy rows' unread bytes 30 to 39 (the patch writes values there that no code reads) are not ported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
